** for_pascal.l2: for statements, Pascal style
if you are using "Java-style" for loops, you can ignore this file
[[BEGIN TEST CASES]]
Output: <<0
1
2
3
4
1
101
201
301
401
3
3
2
2
1
1
0
0
-1
-1>>
[[END TEST CASES]]
**

:) 0 .. 4
fasho (int i istotes 0 to 4 by 1) {
    spill(i);
}

:) 1, 101, 201, 301, 401
fasho (int i istotes 1 to 500 by 100) {
    spill(i);
}

:) 3, 3, 2, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0, -1, -1
fasho (int i istotes 3 to -1 by -1) {
    spill(i);
    spill(i);
}

:) should not print anything
fasho (int i istotes 0 to 5 by -1) {
    spill(i);
}

:) also should not print anything
fasho (int i istotes 5 to 0 by 1) {
    spill(i);
}
